The legislative texts in this repository are from the Laws of Fiji website, https://www.laws.gov.fj, managed by
the Office of the Attorney-General of the Republic of Fiji. The site states no licence for reuse. The texts are
reproduced without change to their wording; only the arrangement (one file per unit, one paragraph per line) is
Lexifina's. This repository is private; check the position under the Copyright Act 1999 (Fiji) before it is made
public.

Lexifina's own contributions (tools, file arrangement, commit messages and documentation) are dedicated to the
public domain under CC0 1.0: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
